OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FExtensive low cloud and fog is
OL,6,Fexpected during the morning, likely
OL,7,Fslow to clear many places. Some
OL,8,Feventual bright or hazy sunny spells
OL,9,Fshould follow during the afternoon,
OL,10,Fwith the odd spot of rain perhaps
OL,11,Farriving in the far south.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy in the south with a
OL,14,Flittle rain possible at times. Drier
OL,15,Fand clearer in the north, with a touch
OL,16,Fof grass frost possible in the most
OL,17,Fsheltered rural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
