OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F167A1794284725
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy and damp in the
OL,6,Fsouth at first, however drier and
OL,7,Fbrighter conditions should edge
OL,8,Fsouthwards from northern parts to
OL,9,Fallow some sunny spells for most. Near-
OL,10,Fnormal temperatures, colder overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FBecoming drier and brighter with some
OL,14,Fsunshine later in the week and into
OL,15,Fthe weekend as temperatures fall away,
OL,16,Fwith overnight frosts developing
OL,17,Fwidely. Perhaps turning more unsettled
OL,18,Flater Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
